            "description" : "<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p>It's ideally suited to teams who produce content for marketing and communications, retail and manufacturing, publishing and education applications.</p>\n<p>Elvis DAM’s easy to use HTML5 interface is optimised to make management of assets easy for the contributors, whilst also providing a branded portal for search, conversion and download of approved content for consumers. In fact, there is even an mobile app to allow team members ‘on the go’ to collaborate and approve content too.</p>\n<p>Elvis DAM is also a great platform for those who want to store and search a lot of archived content of any file type and also provides a Brand Portal for sharing of approved content with trusted suppliers or business users.</p>",
